  "observations": [
    "On both backings, FlushViewOfFile first propagated a cross-extent mapped edit. Two overlapping FlushFileBuffers calls on distinct files succeeded in all three cycles.",
    "The fixture terminated the owned process after both cycle-two acknowledgements with a witness reader open. The independent CPU reader verified the exact three-file namespace and both acknowledged payloads before a fresh attachment wrote again.",
    "The controller retired actionable history after the subsequent edit cycle. The occupied packed and sparse sizes matched their own pre-interruption checkpoints.",
    "This small mounted fixture covers helper interruption after explicit acknowledgements. Larger live namespaces, device interruption, power-loss behavior and throughput require separate evidence."
  ]
